BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CRC 101st session
DTSTART:20260831T080000Z
DTEND:20260928T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20261013T122400Z
UID:indico-event-1017989@indico.un.org
CONTACT:ohchr-crc@un.org
DESCRIPTION:Please use the following browsers to register: Google Chrome\,
  Mozilla\, Firefox\, Safari\, Microsoft Edge or Opera\nGetting started wit
 h INDICO Online Registration in 2 steps:\n1.         Creation of a
 n INDICO account (as first user)\n2.         Meeting registration 
 with your INDICO account Create your INDICO account (only for first accred
 itation).• Click on the link of accreditation for the session • Go to 
 Log-in (top right side of the webpage) • Click on “Create a new accoun
 t” • Fill-out the form •\nIMPORTANT PICTURE REQUIREMENTS: You need t
 o upload one (1) colour photo for the badge request. The photo requirement
 s follow the ICAO standard.\nYou need to upload one (1) photo for the badg
 e request. Your photo must be: Taken against a plain background (White\, 
 Grey or neutral colour) Clear and in focus. Be a close-up of your full hea
 d and upper shoulders Contain no other objects or people. Be in clear cont
 rast to the background. \nA confirmation message will be displayed on the
  screen • You will be notified by e-mail once your request has been appr
 oved\nMeeting Registration with your INDICO account\nOnce logged in with y
 our credentials\, a link will appear to the registration form of the sessi
 on that you wish to attend. • Click on “Register to this Conference”
  and fill out the form. Upload a recent photograph. • Click on Register 
 You will be notified by email once the Secretariat has approved your reque
 st for accreditation.\nUpon approval you will receive a digital badge.\nPl
 ease present your digital badge\, along with your valid passport or identi
 ty card  to the Security Officer at the Palais des Nations Pregny Gate f
 or the identity check.  The digital badge does not need to be printed\, a
 nd presenting it on the mobile phone will be sufficient.\nThe office hours
  are 9 am to 6 pm\, Monday through Friday.\nIMPORTANT Please keep your pas
 sport in hand while filling the form. Your personal data must match your d
 etails on your passport or ID.\nFor any technical issues with INDICO\, ple
 ase contact support.accreditation@un.org and not the Secretariat.\nAll pub
 lic meetings of the Committee will be available through webcast live on th
 e website: https://webtv.un.org/meetings-events. Please note that Confere
 nce Room XII at Palais des Nations\, Third Floor\, is open to the public\,
  during the session\, unless otherwise indicated. \n\nhttps://indico.un.o
 rg/event/1017989/
LOCATION:Room XII (Palais des Nations)
URL:https://indico.un.org/event/1017989/
END:VEVENT
